@startuml Chat_Planning_Flow
title AI Chat & Trip Planning (UC#3 / UC#2) — Analysis View

actor Traveler
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "Backend" as Backend
participant "AI Service" as AI
participant "Database" as DB

== GREETING / SLOT_FILLING Phase ==

Traveler -> App: Open chat and describe trip
activate App

App -> Backend: Send trip request
activate Backend

Backend -> AI: Interpret request and\ncheck for missing details
activate AI

alt Missing information
  AI --> Backend: Ask clarifying question
  Backend --> App: Prompt for more details
  App --> Traveler: Question displayed
  Traveler -> App: Provide additional info
  App -> Backend: Updated request
  Backend -> AI: Complete requirements
end

AI --> Backend: Trip requirements understood
deactivate AI

== PLAN_GENERATION Phase ==

Backend -> DB: Retrieve places matching\nuser preferences
activate DB
DB --> Backend: Place candidates
deactivate DB

Backend -> AI: Generate personalized\nitinerary (Gemini 2.5 Flash)
activate AI
AI --> Backend: Day-by-day itinerary
deactivate AI

Backend -> Backend: Validate itinerary (Groq Llama 3.3 70B)
Backend -> DB: Store generated itinerary
activate DB
DB --> Backend: Itinerary saved
deactivate DB

Backend --> App: Stream itinerary to chat
deactivate Backend

App --> Traveler: Display itinerary
deactivate App

== ITINERARY_REVIEW Phase ==

Traveler -> App: Approve the itinerary or request changes
activate App

App -> Backend: Confirm approval
activate Backend

Backend -> DB: Update trip status
activate DB
DB --> Backend: Status updated
deactivate DB

Backend --> App: Transition to FLIGHT_SELECTION
deactivate Backend

App --> Traveler: "Would you like to book a flight?"
deactivate App

== FLIGHT_SELECTION Phase ==

Traveler -> App: Provide departure city / skip flights
activate App

App -> Backend: Flight request
activate Backend

Backend -> Backend: Search flights via Amadeus
Backend --> App: Flight options listed
deactivate Backend

App --> Traveler: Select or skip flights
deactivate App

== HOTEL_SELECTION Phase ==

Backend -> Backend: Run hotel selection agent
Backend --> App: Hotel options with ratings & amenities
deactivate Backend

Traveler -> App: Pick a hotel or change type
activate App
App -> Backend: Confirm hotel selection
activate Backend
Backend --> App: Hotel saved
deactivate Backend
deactivate App

== BOOKING Phase ==

Backend --> App: "Pay now or do it later?"

alt Pay now
  App --> Traveler: Proceed to payment in app
  Traveler -> App: Complete payment (Stripe)
  App -> Backend: Payment confirmed
  activate Backend
  Backend -> DB: Update bookings and\ntrip status
  DB --> Backend: Status updated
  deactivate Backend
  App --> Traveler: Booking confirmed
else Do it later
  App --> Traveler: Trip finalized, book later
end

Backend -> Backend: Transition to COMPLETED

@enduml
